1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:04,620
Here's where we derived the mass
of the dark-matter particle.

2
00:00:04,784 --> 00:00:06,914
-You've misstated the weight.
-Let me finish.

3
00:00:07,078 --> 00:00:09,918
(Sheldon:)-You're defacing my work.
-I'm not. I'm fixing it.

4
00:00:10,081 --> 00:00:11,711
(Sheldon:)-Give me the eraser.
-No.

5
00:00:11,874 --> 00:00:13,084
(Sheldon:)I said give it to me.

6
00:00:13,543 --> 00:00:15,463
(Raj:)Come and get it.

7
00:00:16,379 --> 00:00:18,129
(Penny:)Fine.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,430
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord.

9
00:00:24,595 --> 00:00:28,475
(Sheldon:)Dr. Koothrappali, as your superior,
I forbid you from writing on my board.

10
00:00:28,641 --> 00:00:31,311
(Raj:)-You are not my superior.
-I am in every way.

11
00:00:31,477 --> 00:00:34,437
(Raj:)Oh, yeah? Can you do this?

12
00:00:38,442 --> 00:00:39,652
(Raj:)Nice working with you.

13
00:00:43,114 --> 00:01:00,024
I'm sorry. "For you."

